# Full SINTRAN boot attempt after the SD-FAT chain fix. Bare & = ALD
# default Winchester autoboot. Fail on the crash; succeed on any sign of
# SINTRAN reaching its operator dialog.
FAILON System malfunction
FAILON ERRFATAL
LABEL boot SINTRAN via bare & (ALD default = Winchester)
SEND &
LABEL waiting for SINTRAN to come up (up to 5 min)
EXPECT 300 SINTRAN|ENTER|DATE|@|OPCOM|VERSION|RT|:
PAUSE 5
